homePage is a page
    title is "Home"
.
aboutPage is a page
    title is "About"
.
notFoundPage is a page
    title is "Not Found"
.
docs is a link
    text is "Docs"
    url is "https://example.com"
.
put docs in homePage
route "/" shows homePage
route "/about" shows aboutPage
route otherwise shows notFoundPage
on route change
    say current route
.
userPage is a page
    title is "User"
.
route "/users/:id" shows userPage
on route change
    say "user" route parameter "id" "tab" query parameter "tab"
.
go to "/users/42?tab=posts"
